  "knownTraps": [
    "Do not move AGY, OpenCode, GNHF, launcher, or other higher-runtime setup into the prerequisite gate.",
    "Do not weaken or delete an ordering assertion because a product refactor changes source tokens; update the contract and validators with the semantic refactor.",
    "Do not treat CI success as proof that WezTerm installed, WSL mutated, tmux ran, a window opened, or an operator accepted the result.",
